<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>500 - Erro Interno</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --color-error: #ef4444;
            --color-neutral-800: #1f2937;
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: var(--color-danger);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .error-container {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--space-lg);
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        
        .error-code {
            font-size: 10rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
            text-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            animation: glitch 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes glitch {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translate(0);
            }
            20% {
                transform: translate(-2px, 2px);
            }
            40% {
                transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
            }
            60% {
                transform: translate(2px, 2px);
            }
            80% {
                transform: translate(2px, -2px);
            }
        }
        
        .error-icon {
            font-size: var(--text-4xl);
            margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
            animation: shake 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes shake {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: rotate(0deg);
            }
            10%, 30%, 50%, 70%, 90% {
                transform: rotate(-5deg);
            }
            20%, 40%, 60%, 80% {
                transform: rotate(5deg);
            }
        }
        
        .error-title {
            font-size: var(--text-3xl);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
        }
        
        .error-message {
            font-size: var(--text-lg);
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        
        .error-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: var(--space-sm);
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .btn {
            padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
            background: white;
            color: var(--color-error);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: var(--text-base);
            transition: all 0.3s;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: var(--space-2xs);
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: white;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
        }
        
        .error-details {
            margin-top: var(--space-xl);
            padding: var(--space-md);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            text-align: left;
            font-size: var(--text-sm);
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .error-details h3 {
            margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
            font-size: var(--text-base);
        }
        
        .error-details code {
            display: block;
            margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
            padding: var(--space-2xs);
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: var(--text-sm);
            overflow-x: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-code">500</div>
        <div class="error-icon">
            <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>
        </div>
        <h1 class="error-title">Erro Interno do Servidor</h1>
        <p class="error-message">
            Algo correu mal do nosso lado.<br>
            A nossa equipa já foi notificada e estamos a resolver o problema.
        </p>
        
        <div class="error-actions">
            <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i>
                Voltar
            </a>
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">
                <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
                Ir para Início
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && process.env.NODE_ENV === 'development') { %>
        <div class="error-details">
            <h3>Detalhes do Erro (Development Mode):</h3>
            <code><%= error.stack || error.message || error %></code>
        </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

